    </encoding>
    <source>Liber Gradualis a S. Gregorio Magno olim ordinatus … (Tournai: Desclée, Lefebvre et Soc., 1883; Solesmes edition prepared by Dom Joseph Pothier), Missa pro Defunctis, Sequentia, pp. [144]–[145] (BnF, département Musique, RES VMC MS-223, Gallica ark:/12148/btv1b104642876, images 764–765, via Wikimedia Commons). Square notation has no note values: every printed note is encoded as a quarter note, one bar per line of verse; neumes are encoded as slurs.</source>
